<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfolio - Muhammad Faris Danial</title>
    <style>
        /* Reset & Base Styles */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        /* Header & Navigation */
        header {
            background-color: #fff;
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #007bff;
        }
        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
        }
        .nav-links li {
            margin-left: 20px;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #007bff;
        }

        /* Sections General */
        section {
            padding: 100px 20px 60px 20px;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        h2::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 50px;
            height: 4px;
            background-color: #007bff;
            margin: 10px auto 0 auto;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        #home {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.85), rgba(255,255,255,0.85)), url('https://unsplash.com') no-repeat center center/cover;
        }
        .hero-content h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #222;
        }
        .hero-content p {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 30px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }

        /* About Section */
        .about-content {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .about-text {
            flex: 2;
            min-width: 300px;
        }
        .about-text p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .info-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        .info-list li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .info-list strong {
            color: #007bff;
        }
        .skills {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 300px;
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .skills h3 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .skill-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            list-style: none;
        }
        .skill-list li {
            background-color: #e9ecef;
            padding: 5px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* Portfolio/Projects Section */
        .project-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .project-card {
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }
        .project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }
        .project-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background-color: #ddd;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        .project-info {
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .project-info h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .project-info p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        /* Contact Section */
        #contact {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .contact-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .contact-links a {
            color: #007bff;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .contact-links a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
            color: #0056b3;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        /* Responsif untuk HP */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }
            .hero-content h1 {
                font-size: 36px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Navigasi -->
    <header>
        <nav>
            <div class="logo">Faris.Dev</div>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">Tentang</a></li>
                <li><a href="#portfolio">Proyek</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Kontak</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero / Utama -->
    <section id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Halo, Saya Muhammad Faris Danial</h1>
            <p>Pelajar & Pengembang Web Pemula</p>
            <a href="#portfolio" class="btn">Lihat Karya Saya</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tentang Saya -->
    <section id="about">
        <h2>Tentang Saya</h2>
        <div class="about-content">
            <div class="about-text">
                <p>Halo! Saya Faris. Saya tertarik dengan dunia teknologi, pemrograman, dan pembuatan website. Saya senang mempelajari hal baru dan terus mengasah kemampuan coding saya untuk menciptakan solusi digital yang kreatif.</p>
                
                <ul class="info-list">
                    <li><strong>Tanggal Lahir:</strong> 30 November 2010</li>
                    <li><strong>Email:</strong> mfarisd30@gmail.com</li>
                    <li><strong>Fokus:</strong> Front-End Web Development</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="skills">
                <h3>Keahlian</h3>
                <ul class="skill-list">
                    <li>HTML5</li>
                    <li>CSS3</li>
                    <li>JavaScript</li>
                    <li>Git & GitHub</li>
                    <li>Desain UI/UX</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Portfolio / Proyek -->
    <section id="portfolio">
        <h2>Proyek Saya</h2>
        <div class="project-grid">
            
            <!-- Proyek 1 -->
            <div class="project-card">
                <img src="https://unsplash.com" alt="Proyek 1" class="project-img">
                <div class="project-info">
                    <h3>Website Portofolio Pribadi</h3>
                    <p>Mendesain dan membangun website portofolio responsif menggunakan HTML dan CSS untuk menampilkan profil diri.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="btn" style="padding: 5px 15px; font-size: 14px;">Lihat Proyek</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Proyek 2 -->
            <div class="project-card">
                <img src="https://unsplash.com" alt="Proyek 2" class="project-img">
                <div class="project-info">
                    <h3>Kalkulator Web Sederhana</h3>
                    <p>Aplikasi kalkulator berbasis web untuk operasi matematika dasar dengan antarmuka yang bersih.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="btn" style="padding: 5px 15px; font-size: 14px;">Lihat Proyek</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Kontak -->
    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Hubungi Saya</h2>
        <p>Saya sangat terbuka untuk kolaborasi proyek, diskusi teknologi, atau sekadar menyapa. Hubungi saya di bawah ini:</p>
        <div class="contact-links">
            <a href="mailto:mfarisd30@gmail.com">📧 Email Saya</a>
            <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank">💻 GitHub</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Muhammad Faris Danial. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
